WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.137
- Dude, I'm starving.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:04.917
Pizza!

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:06.324
- Aw, yes!

00:00:06.324 --> 00:00:07.170
- We deserve it.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.217
- You aren't ordering take out are you?

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:12.239
- Yeah, why?

00:00:12.239 --> 00:00:13.823
- I just bought all those groceries.

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:15.240
There is plenty of food here.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.493
- So much effort, you know?

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:18.306
- Thai food?

00:00:18.306 --> 00:00:20.907
- Pretty sure it'll be cold
by the time it gets here.

00:00:20.907 --> 00:00:22.424
- Sure, with that attitude.

00:00:22.424 --> 00:00:23.802
Plus, I like it better cold.

00:00:23.802 --> 00:00:24.604
- Alright, you know what?

00:00:24.604 --> 00:00:26.439
Whatever, I'm pulling the trigger, okay?

00:00:26.439 --> 00:00:29.514
- This delivery minimum is pretty steep

00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:30.575
for one person though.

00:00:30.575 --> 00:00:32.493
- You could just go walk to pick it up.

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:33.113
Tubby?

00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:34.057
- Brain bubble!

00:00:34.057 --> 00:00:34.976
Stay with me.

00:00:34.976 --> 00:00:38.595
Or, you could add an
appetizer, drink, and desert.

00:00:38.595 --> 00:00:39.949
- You could stick to that diet

00:00:39.949 --> 00:00:42.678
that you've been preaching about
on Instagram for awhile now

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:43.585
- I unfollowed you.

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:44.472
- I got it, right here, sushi.

00:00:44.472 --> 00:00:45.842
I'm having sushi.

00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:48.783
No delivery fee, 1.7 miles away.

00:00:48.783 --> 00:00:50.347
- No, it's always under a cost.

00:00:50.347 --> 00:00:51.833
- You will be hungry again in an hour.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.545
- Oh my god, okay, I'm going
to starve to death then.

00:00:54.545 --> 00:00:55.728
We're going back to pizza.

00:00:55.728 --> 00:00:57.792
I am ordering pizza!

00:00:57.792 --> 00:00:58.798
- So, order the cheap pizza?

00:00:58.798 --> 00:01:00.737
Which will take what,
25 minutes to get here?

00:01:00.737 --> 00:01:03.047
Or, you can order the good
pizza, that will take,

00:01:03.047 --> 00:01:05.585
roughly 90 minutes, regardless
of what time you order.

00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:08.272
- Guys, I am so hungry.

00:01:08.272 --> 00:01:09.272
(iPhone text message)

00:01:09.272 --> 00:01:11.796
- Ouu, Michelle.

00:01:11.796 --> 00:01:15.352
Yeah, where were you thinking?

00:01:15.352 --> 00:01:18.266
Not full smiley-face emoji
but like the, that one.

00:01:18.266 --> 00:01:19.252
Send.

00:01:20.312 --> 00:01:21.277
(iPhone text message)

00:01:21.277 --> 00:01:23.349
- Alright you've got to wine
her and you've got to dine her.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:24.264
- Alright, I'm gonna give
you the top 10 places

00:01:24.264 --> 00:01:25.253
that I would take a girl, ready?

00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:26.585
- Michelle is a special lady.

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:27.818
- Drum roll please, hit it.

00:01:27.818 --> 00:01:29.189
- Don't nickname her Michelle My Belle,

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.053
because she's heard that.

00:01:30.053 --> 00:01:30.764
- Alright, no drum roll.

00:01:30.764 --> 00:01:31.283
- You need to come up
- Fuddruckers,

00:01:31.283 --> 00:01:32.400
- with something new like
- good weekday spot.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.150
- "Michelle, you're swell."
- Chili's, good weekend spot.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.382
- Huh? It doesn't even have to rhyme.

00:01:35.382 --> 00:01:37.059
- Maybe just "Michelle, 'sup?"
- Applebee's, after 10...

